  "reasoning": "The defendant organized construction without permits and safety measures, leading to a collapse of the high formwork that caused the death of a worker. This constitutes a serious work safety accident caused by negligence, which under Chinese criminal law is prosecuted as the crime of causing a major responsibility accident (重大责任事故罪). No other listed offenses apply to the facts.",
